## Interface: 16001
## Title: Scrollkeeper
## Notes: Mage scrolls made easy: one-click Decipher, Study, Familiar and Imbue, skill-up chances, library and book spots on the map, and help from your alts.
## Author: generalwrex
## Version: @project-version@
## SavedVariables: ScrollkeeperDB, ScrollkeeperScan
## Category: Class
## X-License: MIT
## X-Curse-Project-ID: 1808722
## X-Website: https://github.com/generalwrex/Scrollkeeper
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Scroll_03
## AddonCompartmentFunc: Scrollkeeper_OnCompartmentClick
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnEnter: Scrollkeeper_OnCompartmentEnter
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnLeave: Scrollkeeper_OnCompartmentLeave

